  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 502.58 State revolving fund (SRF) financial advisor",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 502.58 “State revolving fund (SRF) financial advisor” means the individual or entity under contract to the department for the purpose of assessing the financial risk of providing financial assistance to non-governmental entities.\n\nSource. #13511, eff 12-20-22",
